<LanguageData>
  <!--EN: {PAWN_labelShort}'s social impact-->
  <VME_BonfireOutcome.comps.0.label>{PAWN_labelShort}的社交影响</VME_BonfireOutcome.comps.0.label>
  <!--EN: participant count-->
  <VME_BonfireOutcome.comps.1.label>参与者数量</VME_BonfireOutcome.comps.1.label>
  <!--EN: Depending on ritual quality, participants will receive a recreation boost that last between 4 hours and 3 days that will raise their recreation bar. They'll also get between {MINMOOD} and {MAXMOOD} mood for {MOODDAYS} days.\n\nThe ritual bonfire will stay lit for at least two quadrums, providing a beauty bonus nearby and counting towards the number of fires around for the Fire: Desired precept.-->
  <VME_BonfireOutcome.description>参与者将获得 4小时 到 3天 的娱乐值增幅并在 {MOODDAYS} 天内获得 {MINMOOD} 到 {MAXMOOD} 的心情值，这取决于仪式的效果。\n\n大型篝火将持续燃烧一段时间，并为周围提供美观度加成，同时也会对“火焰：渴望”戒律的增益效果生效。</VME_BonfireOutcome.description>
  <!--EN: The {0} was terrible! Some pathetic little flames drifted around, and they went away too soon (no recreation effect applied).-->
  <VME_BonfireOutcome.outcomeChances.0.description>{0}非常糟糕！一些微小的火花四处迸射，篝火很快就被烧干净了。\n\n此次仪式没有获得任何娱乐加成。</VME_BonfireOutcome.outcomeChances.0.description>
  <!--EN: Terrible-->
  <VME_BonfireOutcome.outcomeChances.0.label>糟糕的</VME_BonfireOutcome.outcomeChances.0.label>
  <!--EN: The {0} was lackluster. We were expecting a wondrous conflagration, and instead we got an oversized campfire. At least it was kinda entertaining.\n\nRecreation of all participants will be raised for 4 hours.-->
  <VME_BonfireOutcome.outcomeChances.1.description>{0}枯燥乏味。我们本以为会有一场美妙的火灾，结果却只是一堆大号的营火。不过至少还有点意思。\n\n所有参与者将获得4小时的娱乐值增幅。</VME_BonfireOutcome.outcomeChances.1.description>
  <!--EN: Lackluster-->
  <VME_BonfireOutcome.outcomeChances.1.label>枯燥乏味的</VME_BonfireOutcome.outcomeChances.1.label>
  <!--EN: The {0} was good. The flames rose and crackled majestically over the settlement, and it lifted all our spirits considerably.\n\nRecreation of all participants will be raised for 1 day.-->
  <VME_BonfireOutcome.outcomeChances.2.description>{0}令人满意。熊熊燃烧的烈火使我们每个人的精神都振奋了起来。\n\n所有参与者将获得1天的娱乐值增幅。</VME_BonfireOutcome.outcomeChances.2.description>
  <!--EN: Good-->
  <VME_BonfireOutcome.outcomeChances.2.label>令人满意的</VME_BonfireOutcome.outcomeChances.2.label>
  <!--EN: The {0} was glorious! It was super fun and we really connected with each other with the shared experience.\n\nRecreation of all participants will be raised for 3 days.-->
  <VME_BonfireOutcome.outcomeChances.3.description>{0}充满荣耀！每个人都意犹未尽，我们分享了彼此的经验，并真正地联系在了一起。\n\n所有参与者将获得3天的娱乐值增幅。</VME_BonfireOutcome.outcomeChances.3.description>
  <!--EN: Glorious-->
  <VME_BonfireOutcome.outcomeChances.3.label>充满荣耀的</VME_BonfireOutcome.outcomeChances.3.label>
  <!--EN: {PAWN_labelShort}'s social impact-->
  <VME_CeremonialSuicideRitualOutcome.comps.0.label>{PAWN_labelShort}的社交影响</VME_CeremonialSuicideRitualOutcome.comps.0.label>
  <!--EN: room impressiveness-->
  <VME_CeremonialSuicideRitualOutcome.comps.1.label>令人难忘的房间</VME_CeremonialSuicideRitualOutcome.comps.1.label>
  <!--EN: participant count-->
  <VME_CeremonialSuicideRitualOutcome.comps.2.label>参与者数量</VME_CeremonialSuicideRitualOutcome.comps.2.label>
  <!--EN: Depending on ritual quality, participants will get between {MINMOOD} and {MAXMOOD} mood for {MOODDAYS} days. All participants must be healthy to attend.-->
  <VME_CeremonialSuicideRitualOutcome.description>参与者将在 {MOODDAYS} 天内获得 {MINMOOD} 到 {MAXMOOD} 的心情值，这取决于仪式的效果。只有身体健康的殖民者才能参加。</VME_CeremonialSuicideRitualOutcome.description>
  <!--EN: The {0} was terrible! The blade was thrust laterally and there was blood and entrails everywhere. Disgusting!-->
  <VME_CeremonialSuicideRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.0.description>{0}非常糟糕！刀刃刺入身体的角度非常诡异，鲜血与内脏喷洒的到处都是。呕...真恶心!</VME_CeremonialSuicideRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.0.description>
  <!--EN: Terrible-->
  <VME_CeremonialSuicideRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.0.label>糟糕的</VME_CeremonialSuicideRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.0.label>
  <!--EN: The {0} was boring. The speech seemed forced. At the very least we have restored the honor of our colony.-->
  <VME_CeremonialSuicideRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.1.description>{0}非常无聊。这次仪式似乎有些牵强附会，但至少恢复了我们殖民地的部分荣誉。</VME_CeremonialSuicideRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.1.description>
  <!--EN: Boring-->
  <VME_CeremonialSuicideRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.1.label>无聊的</VME_CeremonialSuicideRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.1.label>
  <!--EN: The {0} has restored the honor of our colony. The shadow of defeat no longer clouds our minds.-->
  <VME_CeremonialSuicideRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.2.description>{0}令人感到敬畏。失败的阴影不再笼罩我们的心灵。</VME_CeremonialSuicideRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.2.description>
  <!--EN: Honorable-->
  <VME_CeremonialSuicideRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.2.label>可敬的</VME_CeremonialSuicideRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.2.label>
  <!--EN: The {0} was unforgettable! Everyone will remember the courage, self-control, and strong resolve. The honor of our colony is now spotless.-->
  <VME_CeremonialSuicideRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.3.description>{0}令人难忘！每个人都会牢记勇气、自控以增强自己的决心。我们殖民地的荣誉至高无上！</VME_CeremonialSuicideRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.3.description>
  <!--EN: Unforgettable-->
  <VME_CeremonialSuicideRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.3.label>难忘的</VME_CeremonialSuicideRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.3.label>
  <!--EN: {PAWN_labelShort}'s social impact-->
  <VME_DivineStarsRitualOutcome.comps.0.label>{PAWN_labelShort}的社交影响</VME_DivineStarsRitualOutcome.comps.0.label>
  <!--EN: participant count-->
  <VME_DivineStarsRitualOutcome.comps.1.label>参与者数量</VME_DivineStarsRitualOutcome.comps.1.label>
  <!--EN: Participants will get completely random results, with no regard for ritual quality.-->
  <VME_DivineStarsRitualOutcome.description>参与者得到的结果完全随机，与仪式的效果无关。</VME_DivineStarsRitualOutcome.description>
  <!--EN: Our destiny has been revealed by the stars.-->
  <VME_DivineStarsRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.0.description>我们的命运已由星辰揭示。</VME_DivineStarsRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.0.description>
  <!--EN: Inscrutable-->
  <VME_DivineStarsRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.0.label>神秘的</VME_DivineStarsRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.0.label>
  <!--EN: Our destiny has been revealed by the stars.-->
  <VME_DivineStarsRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.1.description>我们的命运已由星辰揭示。</VME_DivineStarsRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.1.description>
  <!--EN: Inscrutable-->
  <VME_DivineStarsRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.1.label>神秘的</VME_DivineStarsRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.1.label>
  <!--EN: room impressiveness-->
  <VME_IncantationOutcome.comps.0.label>令人难忘的房间</VME_IncantationOutcome.comps.0.label>
  <!--EN: participant count-->
  <VME_IncantationOutcome.comps.1.label>参与者数量</VME_IncantationOutcome.comps.1.label>
  <!--EN: {PAWN_labelShort}'s social impact-->
  <VME_IncantationOutcome.comps.2.label>{PAWN_labelShort}的社交影响</VME_IncantationOutcome.comps.2.label>
  <!--EN: If the incantation ritual goes well (positive outcome) it will increase the corruption need of all participants by 20%, as well as provide a mood bonus.-->
  <VME_IncantationOutcome.description>如果诅咒仪式顺利举行(积极的结果)，所有参与者都将增长10%的堕落值并获得心情增益。</VME_IncantationOutcome.description>
  <!--EN: The {0} was abnormal! An indescribably hideous gibbering! We'd even describe it as squamous, but we don't even know what that is! An unutterable word!-->
  <VME_IncantationOutcome.outcomeChances.0.description>{0}恐怖无比！一种难以言喻的诡异声音环绕在我们周围！虽然我们称之为“鳞状的”，但我们根本就不知道那到底是什么东西，也不知道为什么要这样称呼！啊啊啊啊啊啊啊...有什么...不可名状的...</VME_IncantationOutcome.outcomeChances.0.description>
  <!--EN: Squamous-->
  <VME_IncantationOutcome.outcomeChances.0.label>鳞状的</VME_IncantationOutcome.outcomeChances.0.label>
  <!--EN: The {0} was suitably accursed. A litany of dark morbidities expressed in crime, perversion, and insanity.-->
  <VME_IncantationOutcome.outcomeChances.1.description>{0}十分可憎！这引发了一连串以犯罪、变态和精神错乱为表现的阴暗病态行为。</VME_IncantationOutcome.outcomeChances.1.description>
  <!--EN: Accursed-->
  <VME_IncantationOutcome.outcomeChances.1.label>可憎的</VME_IncantationOutcome.outcomeChances.1.label>
  <!--EN: The {0} was blasphemous. A promise of hidden and fathomless worlds of strange life which pulsate in the gulfs beyond the stars and press hideously upon our own globe in unholy dimensions which only the dead and the moonstruck can glimpse.-->
  <VME_IncantationOutcome.outcomeChances.2.description>{0}亵渎了神明！我们感受到了来自某个极度未知世界中的神秘生命。祂在群星之外的虚无深渊中活动着，并从那个邪恶的维度中向我们的世界发出可怖的威压，只有死人与疯狂之人才能窥视其中的一角。</VME_IncantationOutcome.outcomeChances.2.description>
  <!--EN: Blasphemous-->
  <VME_IncantationOutcome.outcomeChances.2.label>亵渎神明的</VME_IncantationOutcome.outcomeChances.2.label>
  <!--EN: The {0} was loathsome! We live on a placid island of ignorance in the midst of black seas of infinity, and it was not meant that we should voyage far.-->
  <VME_IncantationOutcome.outcomeChances.3.description>{0}令人憎恶无比！在无尽的黑雾汇聚成的海洋中，我们居住在一座平和的小岛上。对外在险恶一无所知的我们决不该出航远行。</VME_IncantationOutcome.outcomeChances.3.description>
  <!--EN: Loathsome-->
  <VME_IncantationOutcome.outcomeChances.3.label>憎恶无比的</VME_IncantationOutcome.outcomeChances.3.label>
  <!--EN: chanter present-->
  <VME_InsectoidHymnRitualOutcome.comps.0.label>颂唱者出席</VME_InsectoidHymnRitualOutcome.comps.0.label>
  <!--EN: participant count-->
  <VME_InsectoidHymnRitualOutcome.comps.1.label>参与者数量</VME_InsectoidHymnRitualOutcome.comps.1.label>
  <!--EN: room impressiveness-->
  <VME_InsectoidHymnRitualOutcome.comps.2.label>令人难忘的房间</VME_InsectoidHymnRitualOutcome.comps.2.label>
  <!--EN: Depending on ritual quality, participants will get between {MINMOOD} and {MAXMOOD} mood for {MOODDAYS} days.-->
  <VME_InsectoidHymnRitualOutcome.description>参与者将在 {MOODDAYS} 天内获得 {MINMOOD} 到 {MAXMOOD} 的心情值，这取决于仪式的效果。</VME_InsectoidHymnRitualOutcome.description>
  <!--EN: The {0} was incredibly uninteresting. Yeah, yeah, insects are cool. Bah.\n\nThe ritual had no effect over the insectoid herder's nest building ability.-->
  <VME_InsectoidHymnRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.0.description>{0}非常无聊。啊，是是是，这些虫子很酷。我呸！\n\n此次仪式对虫族护工的“虫巢构建”技能没有效果。</VME_InsectoidHymnRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.0.description>
  <!--EN: Uninteresting-->
  <VME_InsectoidHymnRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.0.label>无趣的</VME_InsectoidHymnRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.0.label>
  <!--EN: The {0} was awkward. The speech was repetitive, and it did nothing to convince us of the divinity of our beloved insects.\n\nThe ritual had no effect over the insectoid herder's nest building ability.-->
  <VME_InsectoidHymnRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.1.description>{0}令人尴尬。礼赞颂唱的啰里啰唆，它没能让我们能相信心爱的虫族是神圣的。\n\n此次仪式对虫族护工的“虫巢构建”技能没有效果。</VME_InsectoidHymnRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.1.description>
  <!--EN: Awkward-->
  <VME_InsectoidHymnRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.1.label>尴尬的</VME_InsectoidHymnRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.1.label>
  <!--EN: The {0} was very rousing. The chanter showed impressing skill and the hymn appropriately extolled the virtues of our way of life.\n\nThe ritual refreshed the cooldown of the insectoid herder's nest building ability.-->
  <VME_InsectoidHymnRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.2.description>{0}振奋人心！颂唱者的技巧十分高超，礼赞恰如其分地颂扬了我们生活方式的优点。\n\n此次仪式重置了虫族护工的“虫巢构建”技能冷却时间。</VME_InsectoidHymnRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.2.description>
  <!--EN: Rousing-->
  <VME_InsectoidHymnRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.2.label>振奋人心的</VME_InsectoidHymnRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.2.label>
  <!--EN: The {0} was entrancing! We can still hear the mesmerizing words of the hymn, like a myriad insectile legs crawling all over our bodies.\n\nThe ritual refreshed the cooldown of the insectoid herder's nest building ability.\n\nThe ritual also made any insectoids that were assaulting the colony flee.-->
  <VME_InsectoidHymnRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.3.description>{0}令人欣喜若狂！我们仿佛仍能听到礼赞动人的颂词，就好像有无数的虫族爬满了全身。\n\n此次仪式重置了虫族护工的“虫巢构建”技能冷却时间。</VME_InsectoidHymnRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.3.description>
  <!--EN: Entrancing-->
  <VME_InsectoidHymnRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.3.label>令人欣喜的</VME_InsectoidHymnRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.3.label>
  <!--EN: room impressiveness-->
  <VME_LeaderConversionOutcome.comps.0.label>令人难忘的房间</VME_LeaderConversionOutcome.comps.0.label>
  <!--EN: participant count-->
  <VME_LeaderConversionOutcome.comps.1.label>参与者数量</VME_LeaderConversionOutcome.comps.1.label>
  <!--EN: {PAWN_labelShort}'s social impact-->
  <VME_LeaderConversionOutcome.comps.2.label>{PAWN_labelShort}的社交影响</VME_LeaderConversionOutcome.comps.2.label>
  <!--EN: {PAWN_labelShort}'s expectations-->
  <VME_LeaderConversionOutcome.comps.3.label>{PAWN_labelShort}的期望</VME_LeaderConversionOutcome.comps.3.label>
  <!--EN: If it goes well, target's ideoligion certainty will be reduced or they will convert. If it goes badly, they will gain certainty in their old beliefs.-->
  <VME_LeaderConversionOutcome.description>如果进展顺利，目标的文化形态认可度将会降低，或者他们将会转化信仰。如果进展不顺利，他们会对自己的旧信仰更加坚定。</VME_LeaderConversionOutcome.description>
  <!--EN: The {0} was terrible! From the first word, it was a fruitless back-and-forth argument. It dragged on for a cringe-inducingly long time.-->
  <VME_LeaderConversionOutcome.outcomeChances.0.description>{0}太糟糕了！从一开始，这就是一场毫无结果的反复争论。它令人尴尬并且拖了很长时间。</VME_LeaderConversionOutcome.outcomeChances.0.description>
  <!--EN: Terrible-->
  <VME_LeaderConversionOutcome.outcomeChances.0.label>糟糕的</VME_LeaderConversionOutcome.outcomeChances.0.label>
  <!--EN: The {0} was ineffective. Most of the arguments were unclear, and the convertee countered those that made sense.-->
  <VME_LeaderConversionOutcome.outcomeChances.1.description>{0}没什么作用。演讲者大多数论点都不清楚，皈依者反而反驳得头头是道。</VME_LeaderConversionOutcome.outcomeChances.1.description>
  <!--EN: Ineffective-->
  <VME_LeaderConversionOutcome.outcomeChances.1.label>无效的</VME_LeaderConversionOutcome.outcomeChances.1.label>
  <!--EN: The {0} was effective. The speech not only delivered solid arguments and visibly swayed the convertee's thoughts, but kept the crowd entertained as well.-->
  <VME_LeaderConversionOutcome.outcomeChances.2.description>{0}明显起效了。演讲者不仅提供了坚实的论点，明显地动摇了皈依者的信仰，同时也使参与者感到快乐。</VME_LeaderConversionOutcome.outcomeChances.2.description>
  <!--EN: Effective-->
  <VME_LeaderConversionOutcome.outcomeChances.2.label>有效的</VME_LeaderConversionOutcome.outcomeChances.2.label>
  <!--EN: The {0} was masterful! Old beliefs seemed to dissolve effortlessly and inevitably, and our true knowledge was accepted.-->
  <VME_LeaderConversionOutcome.outcomeChances.3.description>{0}效果绝伦。皈依者旧有的信仰毫不费力地垮塌了，我们的信仰被接受了。</VME_LeaderConversionOutcome.outcomeChances.3.description>
  <!--EN: Masterful-->
  <VME_LeaderConversionOutcome.outcomeChances.3.label>精彩绝伦的</VME_LeaderConversionOutcome.outcomeChances.3.label>
  <!--EN: challenge organizer present-->
  <VME_LeadershipChallengeRitualOutcome.comps.0.label>角逐组织者出席</VME_LeadershipChallengeRitualOutcome.comps.0.label>
  <!--EN: room impressiveness-->
  <VME_LeadershipChallengeRitualOutcome.comps.1.label>令人难忘的房间</VME_LeadershipChallengeRitualOutcome.comps.1.label>
  <!--EN: {PAWN_labelShort}'s social impact-->
  <VME_LeadershipChallengeRitualOutcome.comps.2.label>{PAWN_labelShort}的社交影响</VME_LeadershipChallengeRitualOutcome.comps.2.label>
  <!--EN: participant count-->
  <VME_LeadershipChallengeRitualOutcome.comps.3.label>参与者数量</VME_LeadershipChallengeRitualOutcome.comps.3.label>
  <!--EN: Depending on ritual quality, participants will get between {MINMOOD} and {MAXMOOD} mood for {MOODDAYS} days.-->
  <VME_LeadershipChallengeRitualOutcome.description>参与者将在 {MOODDAYS} 天内获得 {MINMOOD} 到 {MAXMOOD} 的心情值，这取决于仪式的效果。</VME_LeadershipChallengeRitualOutcome.description>
  <!--EN: The leadership challenge was terrible! The fighters bumbled around, ineptly avoiding each other in a extended display of cowardice and weakness. Watching it just made people sad.-->
  <VME_LeadershipChallengeRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.0.description>这场领袖角逐非常糟糕。战士们跌跌撞撞，相互笨拙地避开对方的攻击，他们的怯懦与软弱暴露无遗。这可真让人感到悲哀。</VME_LeadershipChallengeRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.0.description>
  <!--EN: Terrible-->
  <VME_LeadershipChallengeRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.0.label>糟糕的</VME_LeadershipChallengeRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.0.label>
  <!--EN: The leadership challenge was boring. The fighters wouldn't commit, so there were no exciting moments. At least our leader is the strongest.-->
  <VME_LeadershipChallengeRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.1.description>这场领袖角逐非常无聊。战士们不愿背负承诺，而且角逐一点都不精彩。但至少我们的领袖仍旧是真正的最强者。</VME_LeadershipChallengeRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.1.description>
  <!--EN: Boring-->
  <VME_LeadershipChallengeRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.1.label>无聊的</VME_LeadershipChallengeRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.1.label>
  <!--EN: The leadership challenge was good. The fighters went for blood and showed real heart. We now know that our leader is the strongest.-->
  <VME_LeadershipChallengeRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.2.description>这场领袖角逐令人满意。战士们洒下鲜血，表现出了自己真正强悍的内心。我们的领袖是真正的最强者。</VME_LeadershipChallengeRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.2.description>
  <!--EN: Good-->
  <VME_LeadershipChallengeRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.2.label>令人满意的</VME_LeadershipChallengeRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.2.label>
  <!--EN: The leadership challenge was unforgettable! Both fighters gave all they had, and we know that our leader is now the strongest among us!-->
  <VME_LeadershipChallengeRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.3.description>这场领袖角逐真令人难忘！两位战士都献出了自身的一切，我们的领袖是真正的最强者!</VME_LeadershipChallengeRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.3.description>
  <!--EN: Unforgettable-->
  <VME_LeadershipChallengeRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.3.label>令人难忘的</VME_LeadershipChallengeRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.3.label>
  <!--EN: orgy organizer present-->
  <VME_OrgyRitualOutcome.comps.0.label>狂欢组织者出席</VME_OrgyRitualOutcome.comps.0.label>
  <!--EN: room impressiveness-->
  <VME_OrgyRitualOutcome.comps.1.label>令人难忘的房间</VME_OrgyRitualOutcome.comps.1.label>
  <!--EN: {PAWN_labelShort}'s social impact-->
