  <VME_OrgyRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.2.description>{0}令人性福！我们互相交融在了一起，共同表达出了我们内心最深处的激情。</VME_OrgyRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.2.description>
  <!--EN: Sexy-->
