  <!--EN: The {0} was exhilarating! We all donned our high-society masquerade masks and uncovered our bodies. A barrage of ecstasy unlike no other made our bodies tremble with barely concealed excitement.-->
  <VME_OrgyRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.3.description>{0}令人愉悦！我们都戴上了上流社会的才会用到的化妆假面，并彼此裸露肉体。一股前所未有的愉悦感让我们的身体不停地颤抖，那种原始的性奋最终喷薄而出。</VME_OrgyRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.3.description>
