  <VME_WickerManBurningOutcome.outcomeChances.2.description>{0}令人满意。囚犯痛苦的哀号会在很长一段时间里引起我们的共鸣。啊...又一个被火焰所吞噬的灵魂。</VME_WickerManBurningOutcome.outcomeChances.2.description>
